  "_doc": "Expansion 1 (Vharlen). A Slagborn reaver with a scythe of volcanic glass who burns farms for the warband. A wide reaping cone that bleeds, a pyre line that leaves burning ground behind, and a scythe circle round himself. At 60% raiders come out of the ash. At 25% he starts the last harvest: a get-in-close ring and burning circles on everyone.",
  "party": "Open world elite. Solo: tough — the burning ground adds up. 2-3: intended. 5+: quick. M5 scaling: health by players tagged; raiders 2 -> 3 at five; pyre lines +1 per extra player.",
